es into digital format in one click only. Download what you own and enjoy your movies offline.\r\n\r\nSEAMLESS INTEGRATION\r\nFandango at Home is supported by Google Chromecast. That's right, you don't have to limit yourself to your phone screen: go big and watch your new movie on your home TV set. \r\n\r\nBy downloading, installing & using this App, you agree to Fandango's Privacy Policy (https://www.nbcuniversal.com/fandango-privacy-policy) and Terms and Policies (https://www.fandango.com/policies/terms-and-policies).\r\n\r\nAd Choices: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/cookies#accordionheader2 \r\n\r\nYour Privacy Choices: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/notrtoo \r\n\r\nCA Notice: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/california-consumer-privacy-act",
